BossAchievementRotGourd: {
	FriendlyName: С какой головы гниёт тыква?
	Description: Одержать победу на Тухлой тыквой — огромным и вонючим овощем из жуткого леса.
}

BossAchievementSpookySpirit: {
	FriendlyName: Who You Gonna Call?
	Description: Одержать победу над Пугающим призраком — злым полтергейстом, отгоняющим незваных гостей.
}

BossAchievementMoco: {
	FriendlyName: Вычихнуть с облегчением
	Description: Одержать победу над Моко — могущественным моклёнком, получившим сверхъестественные силы во время ритуала.
}

BossAchievementDaffodil: {
	FriendlyName: Под корень
	Description: Одержать победу над Нарцисс — ленивым цветочным стражем с глубин Катакомб.
}

BossAchievementOldHunter: {
	FriendlyName: Не каждый охотник желает знать
	Description: Одержать победу над Старым охотником — ожившим трупом и мастером в использовании рогаток.
}

BossAchievementOrroboro: {
	FriendlyName: Око за око, зуб за зуб
	Description: Одержать победу над Урро и Боро — двумя голодными змеями, вылупившимся из одного яйца.
}

BossAchievementSpookFishron: {
	FriendlyName: Как рыба в тыквенных пряностях
	Description: Одержать победу над Герцогом Испугроном — мутантом, терроризирующим тыквенную луну.
}

BossAchievementSpookFishronIce: {
	FriendlyName: Как рыба во льде
	Description: Одержать победу над Герцогом Испугроном во время луны неправильного праздника. Пожалуйста, выйди на улицу.
}

BossAchievementBigBone: {
	FriendlyName: Лечь костьми
	Description: Одержать победу над Черепищем — растительным чудищем, запертым на самом дне Катакомб.
}

EventAchievementEggEvent: {
	FriendlyName: Яйцо всмятку
	Description: Survive the egg incursion's onslaught of fleshy abominations.
}

EventAchievementPandoraBox: {
	FriendlyName: You Moron...
	Description: Open pandora's box and defeat all of the mischevious spirits trapped inside.
}

MiscAchievementTurkeyTamed: {
	FriendlyName: Первое благодарение
	Description: Tame a wild turkey using rotten seeds from the spooky forest. It is very friendly!
}

MiscAchievementGourdCarve: {
	FriendlyName: Светильник Гнилька
	Description: Carve one of the nasty moldy gourds in the spooky forest. Even though it still smells putrid, at least it has the halloween spirit!
}

MiscAchievementKrampusHired: {
	FriendlyName: You're Hired!
	Description: Meet krampus and get hired to deliver his presents to townsfolk.
}

MiscAchievementSentientItem: {
	FriendlyName: Оно живое!
	Description: Combine a sentient heart and a weapon at little eye's cauldron to give it the gift of life.
}

MiscAchievementNoseCultist: {
	FriendlyName: An Impostor Among Us
	Description: Use a cultist's robes to blend in among the fanatics in the temple of moco.
}

MiscAchievementBigDunkEat: {
	FriendlyName: Breakfast With The Dead
	Description: Say hello to the undead fish in the depths, and see how he responds!
}

MiscAchievementBigDunk: {
	FriendlyName: Tummy Troubles
	Description: Feed the sea mine to Big Dunk, sending him to re-extinction.
}

MiscAchievementLittleEyeQuest: {
	FriendlyName: Eye Sore
	Description: Complete little eye's mission for an omelette.
}

EventAchievementSpore: {
	FriendlyName: Choking Fumes
	Description: Visit the spider grotto during a spore storm, where mushrooms emit trippy spores and mites come out to hunt.
}

MiscAchievementBloomHarvest: {
	FriendlyName: Bountiful Harvest
	Description: Harvest a fully grown bloom plant.
}

EventAchievementSpiderWar: {
	FriendlyName: Purple Heart
	Description: Stand your ground valiantly against the powerhouses of the spider army.
}

EventAchievementSpiderWarEnd: {
	FriendlyName: Tide Turning Titan
	Description: Cause the surrender of the arachnid military by killing 20 enemies in the final wave.
}

EventAchievementRaveyard: {
	FriendlyName: Dance 'till You Drop Dead
	Description: Attend one of the many raves that can happen in the swampy cemetery at night.
}

MiscAchievementBloomSeeds: {
	FriendlyName: Horticulturalist
	Description: Become a true farmer by planting one of every different type of bloom seed.
}

MiscAchievementContrabandAcc: {
	FriendlyName: Hyperrealistic Achievement
	Description: Combine a set of the suspicious skeleton's contraband together into a powerful object.
}

MiscAchievementDumbZomboid: {
	FriendlyName: How Did You Get Here?
	Description: Encounter the lost zomboid wandering around your world.
}

MiscAchievementOldHunterQuest: {
	FriendlyName: Let Daylight Into Vermin
	Description: Complete all of the old hunter's bounty hunts for rare, strange creatures.
}

MiscAchievementKrampusQuest: {
	FriendlyName: G.O.A.T.
	Description: Help krampus find a way to save christmas in his own special way.
}

MiscAchievementDahlia: {
	FriendlyName: On Fleek!
	Description: Encounter and kill diva dahlia in the lower catacombs.
}
